    {
        "id": 8,
        "raw": "[name=\"チェン\"]  ぐっ……。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "チェン",
        "content": "ぐっ……。"
    },
    {
        "id": 9,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "raw": "[name=\"ホシグマ\"]  本日三回目のお目覚めですね、おはようございます。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "ホシグマ",
        "content": "本日三回目のお目覚めですね、おはようございます。"
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "raw": "[name=\"チェン\"]  どれだけ気を失っていた？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "チェン",
        "content": "どれだけ気を失っていた？"
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "raw": "[name=\"ホシグマ\"]  ほんの数十秒です。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "ホシグマ",
        "content": "ほんの数十秒です。"
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[name=\"チェン\"]  ――ホシグマ、どけ。私がその上の瓦礫の塊を切り裂く。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "チェン",
        "content": "――ホシグマ、どけ。私がその上の瓦礫の塊を切り裂く。"
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "raw": "[name=\"ホシグマ\"]  それは無理そうです。いま少しでも盾を支える力を緩めれば二人共ぺちゃんこです。小官は大丈夫ですから。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "ホシグマ",
        "content": "それは無理そうです。いま少しでも盾を支える力を緩めれば二人共ぺちゃんこです。小官は大丈夫ですから。"
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[name=\"チェン\"]  だがお前の腕は……。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "チェン",
        "content": "だがお前の腕は……。"
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[name=\"ホシグマ\"]  この程度、問題ありません。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "ホシグマ",
        "content": "この程度、問題ありません。"
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[name=\"チェン\"]  何が問題ないだ！　二階分の瓦礫が盾に乗ってるんだぞ！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "チェン",
        "content": "何が問題ないだ！　二階分の瓦礫が盾に乗ってるんだぞ！"
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[name=\"ホシグマ\"]  確かに長くは保ちません。隊長が早めに目覚めてくれて良かった。屈んで、いつでも飛び出せる体制をとってください。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "ホシグマ",
        "content": "確かに長くは保ちません。隊長が早めに目覚めてくれて良かった。屈んで、いつでも飛び出せる体制をとってください。"
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[name=\"チェン\"]  ――",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "チェン",
        "content": "――"
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[name=\"ホシグマ\"]  コノォォォォォ、どれだけ重かろうが――",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "ホシグマ",
        "content": "コノォォォォォ、どれだけ重かろうが――"
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[CameraShake(duration=1, xstrength=5, ystrength=3, vibrato=30, randomness=50, fadeout=true, block=true)]",
        "type": "camera_shake",
        "duration": "1,",
        "xstrength": "5,",
        "ystrength": "3,",
        "vibrato": "30,",
        "randomness": "50,",
        "fadeout": "true,",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[name=\"ホシグマ\"]  ――ここで屈するものかぁぁぁぁ――",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "ホシグマ",
        "content": "――ここで屈するものかぁぁぁぁ――"
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[CameraShake(duration=1, xstrength=5, ystrength=3, vibrato=30, randomness=50, fadeout=true, block=true)]",
        "type": "camera_shake",
        "duration": "1,",
        "xstrength": "5,",
        "ystrength": "3,",
        "vibrato": "30,",
        "randomness": "50,",
        "fadeout": "true,",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[name=\"ホシグマ\"]  ――こんな重さなどないのと同じだ！！　ガアアッ！！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "ホシグマ",
        "content": "――こんな重さなどないのと同じだ！！　ガアアッ！！"
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[CameraShake(duration=2, xstrength=8, ystrength=8, vibrato=30, randomness=90, fadeout=true, block=true)]",
        "type": "camera_shake",
        "duration": "2,",
        "xstrength": "8,",
        "ystrength": "8,",
